      "gate": "Acceptance gate shown as a proposal\u2014not a recorded test result.",
      "view": "bath"
    },
    {
      "id": "cutover",
      "seconds": 6,
      "title": "05 / Cut over one unit at a time",
      "action": "Isolate the verified unit boundary and tie in the new supplies. The bathroom shows the switch.",
